{#- Shared render-time macros for the four stage commands (SPEC-hm-overhaul-p1 AC-004).
    Imported `with context`, so `config`, `is_codex` and `harness_maker_src_path` are the
    caller's. Everything here is inlined at render time: a stage file reads nothing at run time. -#}

{%- macro cli() -%}
**CLI.** Run every `hm …` below as `uv run --with {{ harness_maker_src_path }} hm …`{% if is_codex %} through the Bash tool{% endif %}, typing the prefix in full.
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- SPEC-choice-cards AC-001: every user choice is a question-tool card; skills/world-model carries a copy. -#}
{%- macro choices() -%}
**Choices.** Ask each choice with {% if is_codex %}`request_user_input` where available{% else %}`AskUserQuestion`{% endif %}; recommendation first, except approvals and equal options. Without the tool: a numbered list, then wait; never choose for the user.
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro wt_on() -%}{{ config.worktree.get('enabled') }}{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro preflight(stage) -%}
{%- if config.worktree.get('enabled') %}

## Task worktree

Run `hm worktree task-preflight <slug> "$(pwd)" --stage hm:{{ stage }} --claude-session-id "$HM_SESSION_ID"`. Its stdout is the task worktree `.worktrees/<slug>/` on branch `hm/<slug>`, shared by every stage of this task: treat that exact path as `<WT>` for every Read, Write and Edit, and `cd <WT>` before each shell command. A `[preflight] … other active session(s)` warning is informational. On `[preflight] … behind …`, rebase onto the base tip with `hm worktree task-refresh <slug> "$(pwd)"` (it refuses a dirty tree and aborts on conflict, leaving the branch untouched).
{%- endif %}
{%- endmacro -%}

{#- A full `hm check` runs the suite, which can take 7-12 minutes; the host kills a foreground Bash
    call at 10. Codex has no background call, so there the rule is only the no-JSON one. -#}
{%- macro long_gate(why=true) -%}
{%- if is_codex %}; no JSON line means the host killed it, never a pass
{%- else %} in the background (`run_in_background: true`, `timeout: 3600000`{% if why %}; a suite outlives the 10-minute foreground cap{% endif %}); no JSON line is never a pass{% endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro ask() -%}{% if is_codex %}`request_user_input`{% else %}`AskUserQuestion`{% endif %}{%- endmacro -%}

{%- macro dispatch(agent, brief) -%}
{%- if is_codex -%}
`spawn_agent(agent_type="{{ agent }}", message=…)` ({{ brief }}; wait for its reply)
{%- else -%}
`Task(subagent_type="{{ agent }}", …)` ({{ brief }})
{%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
